WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.884
"What a beautiful day!" said Emmy.

2
00:00:07.885 --> 00:00:11.425
"I don't want to be in the house.

3
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:14.930
Let's play in the backyard."

4
00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:22.401
"That's a great idea," said Harry.

5
00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:25.268
The kids went outside.

6
00:00:25.269 --> 00:00:31.721
Harry and Emmy played tag.

7
00:00:31.722 --> 00:00:36.518
Oliver was eating a granola bar.

8
00:00:36.519 --> 00:00:39.524
He saw a big green bug in a tree.

9
00:00:39.525 --> 00:00:46.882
Oliver put down his granola bar.

10
00:00:46.883 --> 00:00:52.374
"Look!" said Oliver.

11
00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:56.071
"That bug looks like a leaf!"

12
00:00:56.072 --> 00:01:00.697
"It's a leaf bug," said Emmy.

13
00:01:00.698 --> 00:01:06.892
"Cool!" said Harry.

14
00:01:06.893 --> 00:01:09.765
A bird flew down from the sky.

15
00:01:09.766 --> 00:01:14.577
It pecked at the granola bar.

16
00:01:14.578 --> 00:01:17.529
"Oh no!" cried Oliver.

17
00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:21.041
"A bird is eating my granola bar!"

18
00:01:21.042 --> 00:01:25.698
The bird flew away.

19
00:01:25.699 --> 00:01:28.983
A squirrel jumped onto the bird feeder.

20
00:01:28.984 --> 00:01:33.686
It ate some bird food.

21
00:01:33.687 --> 00:01:37.505
"Ha-ha!" Oliver laughed.

22
00:01:37.506 --> 00:01:41.996
A cat was walking on the fence.

23
00:01:41.997 --> 00:01:44.812
"It's Pickles," said Emmy.

24
00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:49.451
"He's the neighbor's cat."

25
00:01:49.452 --> 00:01:52.673
Pickles jumped down from the fence.

26
00:01:52.674 --> 00:01:59.605
He came over to the kids.

27
00:01:59.606 --> 00:02:02.343
The kids patted Pickles.

28
00:02:02.344 --> 00:02:06.242
The cat purred.

29
00:02:06.243 --> 00:02:09.991
He rolled over onto his back.

30
00:02:09.992 --> 00:02:16.307
"This is fun," said Oliver.

31
00:02:16.308 --> 00:02:20.442
"Our backyard is really exciting!"

32
00:02:20.443 --> 00:02:24.810
Another animal climbed over the fence.

33
00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.569
"Look over there!" said Oliver.

34
00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:32.165
"It's another cat!"

35
00:02:32.166 --> 00:02:40.043
"I don't think that's a cat," said Harry.

36
00:02:40.044 --> 00:02:42.693
"It's a skunk!" cried Emmy.

37
00:02:42.694 --> 00:02:55.391
"Everybody, back in the house!"

